{"meta":{"ui":"data_table","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","turn":"retry","prompt":"Show the twelve invoices you found as a table: number, customer, date, amount and status. I can sort by any column, filter by status, type to search the customer, page through five at a time, tick rows (and a tick-all for the page), and a bar appears with the count and total of what I ticked and a button to send reminders for them.","text":"The errors come from using `row` inside the List without a repeat line, so `row` was never declared. A List needs `each rows` to bind `row`. I also fixed the broken select-all logic and the unsafe pagination.\n\nstate invoices=[{\"id\":\"INV-1001\",\"customer\":\"Acme Ltd\",\"date\":\"2024-03-01\",\"amount\":1200,\"status\":\"Paid\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1002\",\"customer\":\"Birch & Co\",\"date\":\"2024-03-04\",\"amount\":450,\"status\":\"Overdue\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1003\",\"customer\":\"Cedar Labs\",\"date\":\"2024-03-07\",\"amount\":2300,\"status\":\"Open\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1004\",\"customer\":\"Delta Foods\",\"date\":\"2024-03-09\",\"amount\":780,\"status\":\"Paid\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1005\",\"customer\":\"Elm Studio\",\"date\":\"2024-03-12\",\"amount\":320,\"status\":\"Overdue\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1006\",\"customer\":\"Fjord Media\",\"date\":\"2024-03-15\",\"amount\":1550,\"status\":\"Open\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1007\",\"customer\":\"Garnet Ltd\",\"date\":\"2024-03-18\",\"amount\":910,\"status\":\"Paid\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1008\",\"customer\":\"Harbor Inc\",\"date\":\"2024-03-21\",\"amount\":2050,\"status\":\"Overdue\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1009\",\"customer\":\"Iris Partners\",\"date\":\"2024-03-24\",\"amount\":600,\"status\":\"Open\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1010\",\"customer\":\"Juniper Co\",\"date\":\"2024-03-27\",\"amount\":175,\"status\":\"Paid\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1011\",\"customer\":\"Kestrel Ltd\",\"date\":\"2024-03-29\",\"amount\":3100,\"status\":\"Open\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1012\",\"customer\":\"Lumen Works\",\"date\":\"2024-04-02\",\"amount\":540,\"status\":\"Overdue\"}]\nstate sortCol=\"date\"\nstate sortDesc=true\nstate statusFilter=\"All\"\nstate search=\"\"\nstate page=0\nstate picked=[]\nstate pageSize=5\nstate visible=sortByDesc(filter(invoices,r=>(statusFilter==\"All\"||r.status==statusFilter)&&(search==\"\"||contains(lower(r.customer),lower(search)))),r=>r[sortCol])\nstate pageRows=slice(visible,page*pageSize,min(length(visible),page*pageSize+pageSize))\nstate pickedRows=filter(invoices,r=>any(picked,p=>p==r.id))\nstate allOnPage=length(pageRows)>0&&all(pageRows,r=>any(picked,p=>p==r.id))\nColumn gap:10 pad:12 w:390\n  Text.heading \"Invoices\"\n  Input \"Search customer\" =search\n  Row gap:6\n    ChoiceChip \"All\" -> statusFilter=\"All\"; page=0\n    ChoiceChip \"Open\" -> statusFilter=\"Open\"; page=0\n    ChoiceChip \"Paid\" -> statusFilter=\"Paid\"; page=0\n    ChoiceChip \"Overdue\" -> statusFilter=\"Overdue\"; page=0\n  Row gap:6\n    Button.ghost \"Number\" -> sortCol=\"id\"; sortDesc=!sortDesc\n    Button.ghost \"Customer\" -> sortCol=\"customer\"; sortDesc=!sortDesc\n    Button.ghost \"Date\" -> sortCol=\"date\"; sortDesc=!sortDesc\n    Button.ghost \"Amount\" -> sortCol=\"amount\"; sortDesc=!sortDesc\n    Button.ghost \"Status\" -> sortCol=\"status\"; sortDesc=!sortDesc\n  Checkbox \"All on page\" =allOnPage -> picked=allOnPage?filter(picked,p=>!any(pageRows,r=>r.id==p)):unique(append(picked,...map(pageRows,r=>r.id)))\n  List gap:4\n    each pageRows\n      Row gap:6 pad:6\n        Checkbox =isPicked -> picked=isPicked?without(picked,row.id):append(picked,row.id)\n        Text.strong \"{row.id}\"\n        Text.small \"{row.customer} · {formatDate(row.date,\\\"MMM d\\\")} · {money(row.amount,\\\"$\\\",0)} · {row.status}\"\n  Row between\n    Button.outline \"Prev\" -> page=max(0,page-1)\n    Text.muted \"Page {page+1} of {max(1,ceil(length(visible)/pageSize))}\"\n    Button.outline \"Next\" -> page=min(page+1,max(0,ceil(length(visible)/pageSize)-1))\n  if length(picked)>0\n    Card gap:6\n      Text.strong \"{lengt